        "Content": "<ul><li> Exceptional A2-Rated Detached Executive Family Home</li><li> Approx. 195 m² / 2,099 ft² Of Residential Accommodation</li><li> Four Double Bedrooms Plus Ground-Floor Home Office / Bedroom Five</li><li> Principal Bedroom Suite With Fully Fitted Walk-In Wardrobe</li><li> Two En-Suite Bedrooms Plus Family Bathroom And Guest Shower Room</li><li> Comprehensive Fully Wired Smart-Home System</li><li> Integrated Control Of Lighting, Heating, Automated Blinds, Security And Electric Gates</li><li> Air-To-Water Heat Pump With Underfloor Heating</li><li> Heat Recovery Ventilation System</li><li> Triple-Glazed NorDan Windows</li><li> Engineered Oak Herringbone And Wide-Plank Oak Flooring</li><li> Bespoke Fitted Kitchen With Quartz Worktops And Waterfall Island</li><li> Bespoke Fitted Media Walls To Principal Living Areas</li><li> Private South-Facing Rear Garden With Limestone Patio And Pathways</li><li> Detached Block-Built Garden Room Extending To Approx. 22.6 m² / 243 ft²</li><li> Electric Gated Entrance With Gated Access To Both Sides</li><li> Sweeping Tarmacadam Driveway With Cobblelock Off-Street Parking</li><li> Wired For Electric Vehicle Charging</li><li> Stira Access To Partially Floored Attic</li><li> Approx. Five Minutes From Tullamore Train Station</ul>"
